ADDITIONAL NOTES
========================================
REST API Base URLs:
- Primary: https://main.realtime.ably.net (production)
- Legacy: https://rest.ably.io (redirects/aliases)

Authentication Methods:
- Basic Auth: `keyId:keySecret` (e.g., `xVLyHw.gK532w:*****`)
- Token Auth: Bearer token with capabilities

Token Capabilities Format (from documentation):
{
  "*": ["*"]                                    // All capabilities on all resources
  "channel:*": ["publish", "subscribe", "history", "presence"]
  "channel:private:.*": ["publish", "subscribe"] // Private channels
  "channel:presence:.*": ["presence"]
}

Token Request:
POST /keys/{keyId}/requestToken
Body: { "ttl": 3600000, "capability": "{\"*\":[\"*\"]}" }

